{
    "pr_body": "This commit addresses the issue of missing memory tracking for the BitSet in TopN.Row. Instead of introducing BreakingBitSet, we replace the BitSet with a smaller array of offsets in this PR. Nik suggested to remove that BitSet, but I haven't looked into that option yet.\r\n\r\nCloses #100640\r\nCloses #102683\r\nCloses #102790\r\nCloses #102784",
